o save themselves from Detroit\'s most ruthless drug k...','TV-MA',0,5.2,21,35,32561022),('tt9900782','movie','Kaithi','Kaithi',2019,145,'Action,Adventure,Crime','India','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BZjk4Njg4YjktYzU5Zi00ZWY1LWE4NTUtNWI2MjU4MDE3ZGRmXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyODIwMDI1NjM@._V1_SX300.jpg','Dilli, an ex-convict, endeavours to meet his daughter for the first time after leaving prison. However, his attempts are interrupted due to a drug raid planned by Inspector Bejoy.','Not Rated',0,8.5,NULL,NULL,32561891),('tt9907782','movie','The Cursed','Eight for Silver',2021,111,'Fantasy,Horror,Mystery','United Kingdom, France, United States','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjllNWFhZWUtN2NlNi00NDBmLWE5MjgtMGM3ZGQyNjk1NjQ5XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMTM1MTE1NDMx._V1_SX300.jpg','In rural 19th-century France, a mysterious, possibly supernatural menace threatens a small village. John McBride, a pathologist, comes to town to investigate the danger - and exorcise some of his own demons in the process.','R',4588389,6.3,71,62,32565182),('tt9916362','movie','Coven','Akelarre',2020,92,'Drama,History','Spain, France, Argentina','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BZTc0NGZlZmMtNmZkYS00YzFlLTgyZjgtM2U0ZGJlNDI1NTA2XkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMTM2Mzg4MA@@._V1_SX300.jpg','Basque Country, 1609. The men of the region are at sea and Amaia takes part for the first time in the nightly dances in the woods with the other villager girls. She is only 20. At dawn, they are all arrested.','TV-MA',0,6.4,NULL,NULL,32569132);
